  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      337.8,
      539.59,
      420.8
    ],
    "text": "(AMENDMENT) ACT No. 28 OF 1964 Notice under Section 7 Ref. No.: DSK/LND/07/FI/22/ACQ/139. I hereby give notice under Sub - section (1) of the Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition ( Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to a acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      419.83,
      539.64,
      621.2
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: F.V.P. 139(Supplementary 1) The undermentioned land is situated in the village of Meegahahena in the Katuwana Divisional Secretary Division in North Giruwa Pattu in Hambantota District:- Lot Name of Land Description Extent 33 Kaluwegewatta and Maragahawatta Garden containing 11 coconut trees about A. R. P. 10 \u2013 75 years old, 3 jak trees about 75 02 00 00 years old, 63 Bread fruit trees about 10 years old and a permanent masonary school building with a tiled roof. All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat Katuwana on the 29th day of August 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd August 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
